      {
        "label": "阴影 3 - Shadow 3",
        "value": "rgba(9,30,66,…)",
        "cssValue": "rgba(9,30,66,…)",
        "description": "Shadow Philosophy: Shadows use Trello's signature navy tint (`rgba(9,30,66,…)`) rather than pure black, so they read correctly on both pale lists and colored backdrops. Elevation is meaningful: a card at rest has a whisper-thin shadow; the moment you pick it up the shadow jumps dramatically — depth communicates \"this is now in your hand\". Lists have just enough shadow to lift off the backdrop."
      }
    ],
